{
  "_about": [
    "Place names and coordinates. HAND-AUTHORED and NOT derived from game data.",
    "",
    "The CLE config carries no place names at all -- mapgrouppos.xml is coordinates and",
    "building class names, nothing else. Road-sign text lives in the terrain object data",
    "inside the PBOs, which Bohemia does not publish. So this file is human knowledge, and",
    "it is the one place in the project where that is true.",
    "",
    "`cyrillic` is what the in-game signs actually read, which is what you navigate by.",
    "These are transliterations and should be CORRECTED AGAINST SIGNS SEEN IN GAME -- treat",
    "any of them as provisional until someone has stood in front of the sign.",
    "",
    "Coordinates ARE validated at build time: every place must have buildings near it, or",
    "the build fails. That catches a fat-fingered coordinate, which is the failure mode that",
    "would otherwise silently mislabel half the map."
  ],
  "minBuildingsWithin": {
    "radius": 400,
    "count": 4
  },
